  "update_count": 36,
  "description_snippet": "# VULNERABILITY DETAILS\n\nUse-after-free in `RenderFrameHostImpl::ExitFullscreen()` due to missing `base::WeakPtr` guard after `delegate_->ExitFullscreenMode()`. The delegate call can spin a nested message loop on Windows (via `::SetWindowPos`), during which the `RenderFrameHostImpl` can be destroyed"
